### Query - get friends
POST http://18.191.234.29:3000/graphql
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "query ($userId: Int!, $sortBy: UserSortType!) { getFriendships(id: $userId, sort_by: $sortBy) { success friendships { friend {id first_name last_name point {points} } role status } errors { field message } } }",
  "variables": {
    "userId": 11,
    "sortBy": "POINTS_WEEKLY"
  }
}

### Query - get friend requests
POST http://localhost:3000/graphql
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "query ($id: Int!, $role: String!) { getFriendRequests(id: $id, role: $role) { success friendships { friend {id first_name last_name } role status } errors { field message } } }",
  "variables": {
    "id": 1,
    "role": "receiver"
  }
}

